      "comments": 708,
      "author": "acossta",
      "published": "2026-10-28T17:01:23Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Google's intensive Gemini training and inference cycles drive substantial data center power draw, impacting corporate net-zero carbon targets.",
        "Emphasizes the operational trade-offs of hyperscale AI workloads, highlighting grid constraints and clean energy procurement challenges.",
        "Encourages adoption of efficient architectures, aggressive quantization, and smaller models like Gemini Flash to curtail per-token energy footprints."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
